		<summary><![CDATA[The Midnight Mercs Gaming Community aims for simple enjoyment of whatever game that's is being played, without all of the drama that's included in most clans. Our main goals are not only to provide a fun and enjoyable gaming atmosphere for guests / veterans alike, but to filter anything that could possibly ruin a gaming experience. If you're having troubles within the community it's guaranteed that if you tell an admin, it'll be solved as soon as possible. Interested in joining? Head over to our website below.<br><br><a class="bb_link" href="https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.midnightmercs.enjin.com" target="_blank" rel=" noopener" >Midnight Mercenaries Website</a><span class="bb_link_host">[www.midnightmercs.enjin.com]</span>]]></summary>
